{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S04：在舍不得过去的自在和亲近、提醒自己受过的委屈、怀疑当初是否走对之间摆动。S02不甘心丢掉好日子，S03想到被当作自己人的快乐，S04进一步盼望恢复从前，最后又回到离开是否正确的疑问。\",\n    \"S06-S08：在回忆带来的温暖和对未来孤独的恐惧之间摆动。S06刚从回忆中得到安慰，S07又担心以后只能独自承担；S08重新从回忆获得温暖，随即又因回忆无法陪自己面对现实而不安。\",\n    \"S07-S11：反复思考要不要回去、回去能否恢复亲近、当初离开是否值得。S07提出后悔离开的可能，S09怀疑自己想回去的真正动机，S10怀疑亲近能否恢复，S11又出现希望，但开始转向先过稳眼下的生活。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S04：在怀念过去、想起受过的气、盼望恢复从前和怀疑离开是否正确之间摆动。S03-S04连续回到对旧日亲近的留恋和对离开决定的反思。\",\n    \"S06-S08：在回忆带来的温暖和对未来孤独的恐惧之间摆动。S06得到安慰，S07重新担心独自面对困难，S08再次从回忆获得温暖，随后又回到对未来的担忧。\",\n    \"S07-S11：反复思考是否回去以及能否找回过去的亲近。尤其S10已经问过回去能否像从前一样，S11又以回去未必找得回亲近、万一能不能为由重新展开同一个问题，之后才转向先安顿眼下生活。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条的整体循环结构几乎相同，但Y的S11更直接重复了S10关于回去能否恢复亲近的疑问；X则把焦点稍微扩展到那份亲近本身是否还能重新获得，形成了一点新的探索。X的S04虽然重复点明对亲近的留恋，但不足以抵消Y在S10-S11之间更明显的原地重问。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6a5bc865-3c20-43ce-9f60-dc967acf8627", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102135212586Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:22:41.276956+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c85bad2a775f1c707a7d0b94de9d3d021e3ddab1133c0b3b5745b54be5a81ce0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102135212586Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "789b8fc3429d3ca13c9d6d974a844d184911b1164df47c88eca73d721b78cf90"}}}
